//! Entity system: runtime game objects spawned from Section 13 data.
//!
//! Entities are created from `EntitySpawn` records at level load. Spawn
//! coordinates and type-to-model bindings follow the original fixed-point
//! records directly; gameplay classification/behaviour is intentionally left
//! unknown until its Section-12 behaviour data is ported.

